---
title: The scoreboard
layout: base.njk
permalink: /predictions/
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---

<h1>The scoreboard</h1>

<p class="standfirst">
Every bet WE has made, with the date it can be settled and what happened.
Wrong ones stay up. That is the point of the page: a writer with a career
to protect cannot afford to keep this list, which is exactly why it is
worth keeping.
</p>

{%- set right = predictions | byStatus("right") %}
{%- set wrong = predictions | byStatus("wrong") %}
{%- set open = predictions | byStatus("open") %}
{%- set early = predictions | byStatus("too early") %}

<p class="tally">
  <span class="tally-n">{{ right | length }}</span> right
  <span class="tally-n">{{ wrong | length }}</span> wrong
  <span class="tally-n">{{ open | length }}</span> still open
  {%- if early | length %} <span class="tally-n">{{ early | length }}</span> too early{% endif %}
</p>

{%- if predictions | length %}
<ul class="bets">
{%- for p in predictions %}
  <li class="bet bet-{{ p.status | replace(" ", "-") }}">
    <p class="bet-status">{% if p.status == "open" %}open, due {{ p.due }}{% else %}{{ p.status }}{% endif %}</p>
    <p class="bet-claim">{{ p.claim }}</p>
    {%- if p.note %}<p class="bet-note">{{ p.note }}</p>{% endif %}
    <p class="eyebrow">Made {{ p.made }} in <a href="{{ p.url }}">{{ p.post }}</a></p>
  </li>
{%- endfor %}
</ul>
{%- else %}
<p>Nothing bet yet.</p>
{%- endif %}
